@segment   tuning-hum
@title     The Tuning Hum
@levels    F10, F11, F12, F15
@duration  ~1m30s

say You've been breathing with the rise and fall of the waves. Let that same rhythm carry you now into sound.
pause 4
say On your next exhale, let a hum rise up from low in your chest. Quiet. Easy. Not a performance, just a tone that feels right in your body.
pause 5
say This is your instrument, and you're tuning it.
hold 60
say Let the hum settle. You can let your breath return to its own quiet rhythm.
pause 6
